@startuml Skill_Exchange_Activity_Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10

start

:Learner logs into Skill Exchange Platform;
:Browse catalog & apply category/proficiency/credit filters;
:Select desired Skill Listing;

if (Review instructor profile & availability slots) then (Select open slot)
  :Choose specific date & time slot;
else (Custom request)
  :Propose preferred session date & time;
endif

:Learner requests session booking;
:System checks Learner credit balance vs skill credit cost;

if (Learner credit balance >= listing credit cost?) then (No)
  :Display "Insufficient Credits" error;
  :Prompt learner to earn credits by teaching or claim initial grant;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Create Booking with status **Pending**;
  :Send notification to Skill Provider;
endif

|Skill Provider|
:Provider reviews pending booking request & student notes;

if (Provider decision?) then (Reject)
  :Set status to **Rejected**;
  :Release availability slot;
  :Notify learner;
  stop
else (Accept)
  |Credit Engine|
  :Atomically validate balance;
  :Deduct credits from Learner account;
  :Generate unique transaction ID (CTX-...);
  :Record **session_redemption** in Credit Ledger;
  :Mark booking **Confirmed**;
  :Generate meeting room link;
  :Reserve slot on calendar;
endif

|Session Execution|
if (Cancellation requested before session?) then (Yes)
  :Cancel booking;
  if (Credit was already deducted?) then (Yes)
    :Restore credits to Learner;
    :Record **session_refund** in Credit Ledger;
  endif
  :Release availability slot;
  :Notify participants;
  stop
else (No)
  :Learner and Provider attend 1-on-1 session;
endif

|Session Completion|
:Provider clicks "Mark as Completed";
|Credit Engine|
:Verify session completion;
:Award teaching credits (+X) to Provider;
:Record **teaching_reward** in Credit Ledger;
:Update booking status to **Completed**;

|Feedback Loop|
:Learner receives feedback prompt;
:Learner submits 1-5 Star rating and comment;
:System recalculates Provider & Listing average ratings;
:Provider rating profile updated;

stop

@enduml